{
  "uid": "api-overview",
  "title": "API overview",
  "description": "Traffic, errors, latency, logs and traces for animerec and akashic.",
  "tags": [
    "animerec",
    "akashic"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}, service)",
          "refId": "service"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}, service)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "text": "akashic",
          "value": "akashic"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "level",
        "label": "log level",
        "type": "custom",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "query": "debug,info,warn,error,fatal",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "search",
        "label": "log search",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**One app at a time:** pick it in **service** above. Everything on this page is about the same app.\n\n| Where it comes from | What it's for | Try this |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Tempo** stores a *trace* per request: a tree of timed *spans*, the request at the root and the work it did underneath. Tempo also turns spans into request counts and latencies, which is where the graphs below come from. | *Why was this request slow? Where did it fail?* | In **Latency by route**, turn on the dots (exemplars). Each one is a real request; click it and choose *View trace*. |\n| **Loki** stores the API's log lines, each labelled `service_name` and carrying the `trace_id` of the request that wrote it. | *What did the code say while it ran?* | In **Logs**, open a line and click **Tempo** next to `trace_id` to jump to its trace. |\n| **Prometheus** stores numbers over time. | *How much, how often, how fast?* | Every graph here is Prometheus. Open a panel's menu, **Explore**, to see and edit its PromQL. |\n\n**A normal investigation:** a spike in **Errors** \u2192 the route in the legend \u2192 **Failed requests** below for that route \u2192 open one \u2192 the span in red shows where \u2192 **Logs for this span** shows what the code logged.\n\nTo query by hand, use **Explore** (compass icon, left): pick Loki, Tempo or Prometheus and start from the queries on this page.\n"
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Golden signals: traffic, errors, latency (Prometheus, built from Tempo's spans)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests / s",
      "description": "Every HTTP request the API served, per second.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"$service\", span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx error ratio",
      "description": "Share of requests that failed on the server side. 4xx are the client's mistakes and are not counted.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"$service\", span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\", status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"$service\", span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 latency",
      "description": "95% of requests finished faster than this.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{service=\"$service\", span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.3
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error log lines",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "description": "Log lines at error or fatal level in the selected range (Loki).",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=\"$service\"} | severity_text=~\"error|fatal\" [$__auto]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests / s by route",
      "description": "Traffic per route pattern. The name is the route, not the path, so /anime/:id is one line.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (span_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"$service\", span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors / s by route (5xx)",
      "description": "Server-side failures per route.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (span_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"$service\", span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\", status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "No server errors",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency by route: p95 (dots are real requests: click one for its trace)",
      "description": "p95 per route. Each dot (exemplar) is one request that fell in that bucket; click it, then View trace.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, span_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{service=\"$service\", span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Logs (Loki)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Log volume by level",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "description": "How many lines per level. A red bar is worth opening the logs below for.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{severity_text}}",
          "expr": "sum by (severity_text) (count_over_time({service_name=\"$service\"} [$__auto]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "info"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "warn"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "error"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "fatal"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "dark-red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "debug"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs (open a line; the Tempo button next to trace_id opens its request)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "description": "Filter with the search box above. Each line's fields (method, path, status, trace_id...) are in its details.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "expr": "{service_name=\"$service\"} |~ \"(?i)$search\" | severity_text=~\"$level\" | line_format `{{ if .component }}[{{ .component }}] {{ end }}{{ __line__ }}{{ if .method }}  {{ .method }} {{ .path }} \u2192 {{ .status }} in {{ .ms }}ms{{ end }}`"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "id": 12,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traces (Tempo)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 13,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 50,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Recent requests",
      "description": "The newest requests. Click a trace ID to open its span tree.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"$service\" && kind=server}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 14,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 51,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Slowest requests (> 100 ms)",
      "description": "Anything over 100 ms. Open one and look for the widest span: that's where the time went.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"$service\" && kind=server && duration > 100ms}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 15,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 51,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Failed requests",
      "description": "Requests with a span marked as an error. The red span in the tree is where it broke.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"$service\" && (status=error || span.http.response.status_code >= 500)}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 16,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 61,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Background work (outbox)",
      "description": "Events handled after the request that caused them committed, e.g. updating permissions after a join.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"$service\" && name=~\"outbox.*\"}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 17,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 61,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Dependencies",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 18,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 71,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "OpenFGA permission check latency (akashic)",
      "description": "Time each authorization check takes (5m window: checks are sparse). Only akashic uses OpenFGA.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(fga_client_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{service_name=\"$service\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(fga_client_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{service_name=\"$service\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "noValue": "No permission checks (animerec has none)",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 19,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 72,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      }
    }
  ]
}